tools.description:
Turns an address, a place name or a city into coordinates (latitude, longitude) with its full address, type and country. Worldwide, any language.
Use when: you need coordinates for a map, a distance, weather or places_near.
Example: {"query":"Grand-Place, Brussels"}

Turns a latitude/longitude into the nearest address (street, postcode, city, country).
Use when: you have GPS coordinates and need a readable address.
Example: {"lat":48.8584,"lon":2.2945}
